# Platform email template

Authoritative contract: `docs/platforms/backend/modules/runtime-integrations.md` §6.

## Files

- Mail HTML: `backend/src/resources/emails/main.twig` (`MainEmail.htmlView()` → `"main"`).
- HTTP verify page: `backend/src/resources/views/main.twig` — **not** outbound mail. `VerifyEmailController` renders that file.

## Header

- Identity is the hosted on-dark mark: `https://ejtmaa.live/images/light_logo.png` (`website/public/images/light_logo.png`).
- Do **not** type اجتماع / EJTMAA in the header (the mark already is the wordmark).
- Do **not** CID-embed or attach the logo in `MainEmail.emailOptions()`. Attachments stay `refs.attachments` only.
- Do **not** use `/images/logo.png` (that file does not exist).

## Copy

- Footer positioning line must match `website/src/resources/translations/ar.ts` `pages.home.hero.title`. Do not invent slogans.

## Chrome tokens

- Navy `#0B2057`, orange `#EC6901`, page `#F0F4FA`.
- CTA background is always brand orange. Ignore `link.color` / `*FontSize` / `*Color` refs in the Twig.

## Test send

- One console sub: `EjtmaaConsole` `@consoleSub("send test email")`. Await `sendEmail`. Do not add a second console tree.
